les.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob060\\\"}, \\\"additionalProperty\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"0.625mm\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightness\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"600 nits\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Resolution\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"960 x 540 per panel\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Warranty\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\\\"}]}14:Tb81,{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"FAQPage\\\", \\\"mainEntity\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What makes COB MicroLED 0.6mm different from traditional SMD LED displays?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"COB MicroLED 0.6mm uses flip-chip Chip-on-Board technology which reduces solder points by 40% and doubles the lifespan compared to traditional SMD LEDs. This results in superior reliability, higher pixel density, and reduced maintenance costs.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What environments is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm best suited for?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"This LED display is engineered specifically for 24/7 operation in high-precision environments such as broadcast studios and command centres where pixel-level accuracy and durability are critical.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm display and is it suitable for well-lit rooms?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"With a brightness of 600 nits, this display delivers vibrant visuals optimized for indoor settings like studio environments and control rooms, maintaining clarity even in well-lit spaces.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What installation and maintenance features does this product offer?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The COB MicroLED 0.6mm features front magnetic serviceability for easy module replacement and maintenance without dismantling the entire setup, minimizing downtime and installation complexity.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What warranty and lifespan can I expect from this display?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The display boasts a lifespan of up to 100,000 hours with high durability thanks to advanced flip-chip COB technology. Warranty specifics depend on purchase agreements but typically align with industry standards for premium LED solutions.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does the pixel pitch of 0.625mm improve visual quality?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"A pixel pitch of 0.625mm provides sub-millimetre resolution, ensuring crystal-clear images with extremely fine detail, making it ideal for applications requiring precise visuals such as live broadcasts and critical monitoring.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm energy efficient compared to other LED types?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Yes, it offers approximately 40% power savings compared to conventional SMD LEDs, making it an energy-efficient option that reduces operational costs over time.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does this product compare to other microLED options in the market?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"This model's flip-chip COB architecture enables superior pixel density and reliability with lower power consumption and a higher refresh rate of 7,680Hz, outperforming many standard microLED alternatives.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$14\\\"}}],\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",\\\"$L17\\\"],\\\"$L18\\\"]}]\\n15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Products\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 3, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"COB MicroLED 0.6mm\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob060\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}]\\n16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"legalName\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"contactPoint\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ContactPoint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"contactType\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}]\\n17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T69d,\\u003ch1\\u003eCOB MicroLED 0.6mm\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover the COB MicroLED 0.6mm for ultra-high resolution LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for cutting-edge display solutions today!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSub-millimetre COB. The future, delivered today.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNext-generation Chip-on-Board technology at 0.6mm pixel pitch. Flip-chip COB architecture reduces solder points by 40% and doubles lifespan versus SMD. Engineered for 24/7 command centres and broadcast studios where pixel-level precision is mission-critical.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat makes COB MicroLED 0.6mm different from traditional SMD LED displays?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCOB MicroLED 0.6mm uses flip-chip Chip-on-Board technology which reduces solder points by 40% and doubles the lifespan compared to traditional SMD LEDs. This results in superior reliability, higher pixel density, and reduced maintenance costs.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat environments is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm best suited for?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis LED display is engineered specifically for 24/7 operation in high-precision environments such as broadcast studios and command centres where pixel-level accuracy and durability are critical.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm display and is it suitable for well-lit rooms?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith a brightness of 600 nits, this display delivers vibrant visuals optimized for indoor settings like studio environments and control rooms, maintaining clarity even in well-lit spaces.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat installation and maintenance features does this product offer?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe COB MicroLED 0.6mm features front magnetic serviceability for easy module replacement and maintenance without dismantling the entire setup, minimizing downtime and installation complexity.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"COB MicroLED 0.6mm | Premium LED Display Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Discover the COB MicroLED 0.6mm for ultra-high resolution LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for cutting-edge display solutions today!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob060\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"\"]\n7:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n8:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nb:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\ne:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3a