Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Tb81,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes COB MicroLED 0.6mm different from traditional SMD LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"COB MicroLED 0.6mm uses flip-chip Chip-on-Board technology which reduces solder points by 40% and doubles the lifespan compared to traditional SMD LEDs. This results in superior reliability, higher pixel density, and reduced maintenance costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What environments is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED display is engineered specifically for 24/7 operation in high-precision environments such as broadcast studios and command centres where pixel-level accuracy and durability are critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm display and is it suitable for well-lit rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 600 nits, this display delivers vibrant visuals optimized for indoor settings like studio environments and control rooms, maintaining clarity even in well-lit spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation and maintenance features does this product offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The COB MicroLED 0.6mm features front magnetic serviceability for easy module replacement and maintenance without dismantling the entire setup, minimizing downtime and installation complexity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and lifespan can I expect from this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display boasts a lifespan of up to 100,000 hours with high durability thanks to advanced flip-chip COB technology. Warranty specifics depend on purchase agreements but typically align with industry standards for premium LED solutions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the pixel pitch of 0.625mm improve visual quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A pixel pitch of 0.625mm provides sub-millimetre resolution, ensuring crystal-clear images with extremely fine detail, making it ideal for applications requiring precise visuals such as live broadcasts and critical monitoring.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm energy efficient compared to other LED types?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it offers approximately 40% power savings compared to conventional SMD LEDs, making it an energy-efficient option that reduces operational costs over time.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to other microLED options in the market?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model's flip-chip COB architecture enables superior pixel density and reliability with lower power consumption and a higher refresh rate of 7,680Hz, outperforming many standard microLED alternatives.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"],\"$L18\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"COB MicroLED 0.6mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob060\\\"}]}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n17:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n19:T69d,<h1>COB MicroLED 0.6mm</h1><p>Discover the COB MicroLED 0.6mm for ultra-high resolution LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for cutting-edge display solutions today!</p><p><strong>Sub-millimetre COB. The future, delivered today.</strong></p><p>Next-generation Chip-on-Board technology at 0.6mm pixel pitch. Flip-chip COB architecture reduces solder points by 40% and doubles lifespan versus SMD. Engineered for 24/7 command centres and broadcast studios where pixel-level precision is mission-critical.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes COB MicroLED 0.6mm different from traditional SMD LED displays?</h3><p>COB MicroLED 0.6mm uses flip-chip Chip-on-Board technology which reduces solder points by 40% and doubles the lifespan compared to traditional SMD LEDs. This results in superior reliability, higher pixel density, and reduced maintenance costs.</p><h3>What environments is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm best suited for?</h3><p>This LED display is engineered specifically for 24/7 operation in high-precision environments such as broadcast studios and command centres where pixel-level accuracy and durability are critical.</p><h3>How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm display and is it suitable for well-lit rooms?</h3><p>With a brightness of 600 nits, this display delivers vibrant visuals optimized for indoor settings like studio environments and control rooms, maintaining clarity even in well-lit spaces.</p><h3>What installation and maintenance features does this product offer?</h3><p>The COB MicroLED 0.6mm features front magnetic serviceability for easy module replacement and maintenance without dismantling the entire setup, minimizing downtime and installation complexity.</p>18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"COB MicroLED 0.6mm | Premium LED Display Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover the COB MicroLED 0.6mm for ultra-high resolution LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for cutting-edge display solutions today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob060\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/0glh4djm8_vrx.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\",\"image\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/bl-cob060\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"d59rBE55FstXJAjtgGQzt\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"\"]\n7:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n8:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nb:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\ne:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],