\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n6:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T69d,<h1>COB MicroLED 0.6mm</h1><p>Discover the COB MicroLED 0.6mm for ultra-high resolution LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for cutting-edge display solutions today!</p><p><strong>Sub-millimetre COB. The future, delivered today.</strong></p><p>Next-generation Chip-on-Board technology at 0.6mm pixel pitch. Flip-chip COB architecture reduces solder points by 40% and doubles lifespan versus SMD. Engineered for 24/7 command centres and broadcast studios where pixel-level precision is mission-critical.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes COB MicroLED 0.6mm different from traditional SMD LED displays?</h3><p>COB MicroLED 0.6mm uses flip-chip Chip-on-Board technology which reduces solder points by 40% and doubles the lifespan compared to traditional SMD LEDs. This results in superior reliability, higher pixel density, and reduced maintenance costs.</p><h3>What environments is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm best suited for?</h3><p>This LED display is engineered specifically for 24/7 operation in high-precision environments such as broadcast studios and command centres where pixel-level accuracy and durability are critical.</p><h3>How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.6mm display and is it suitable for well-lit rooms?</h3><p>With a brightness of 600 nits, this display delivers vibrant visuals optimized for indoor settings like studio environments and control rooms, maintaining clarity even in well-lit spaces.</p><h3>What installation and maintenance features does this product offer?</h3><p>The COB MicroLED 0.6mm features front magnetic serviceability for easy module replacement and maintenance without dismantling the entire setup, minimizing downtime and installation complexity.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__htm